FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Stop recurring hourly job failures from dangling artifacts and [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]in-flight prompt archives[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The hourly artifact_retention job reclaims dangling index rows [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]instead of failing forever on a missing stored file, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]agent_publication no longer emits axe digest errors for deferred [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]prompt archives that are only seconds-to-minutes old and resolve on[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]their own.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]hourly_job_error_hardening.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/hourly_job_error_hardening.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-1t0[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-1t0/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifact retention tolerates dangling stored files[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retention[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retention: let the trash store accept a missing payload on opt-in, pass [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the flag from the retention pass, and keep purge running so one bad row [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never wedges the hourly job.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Grace window for unresolved deferred prompt archives[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pubnoise[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pubnoise: treat a young unresolved prompt archive as a deferral (no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]error, no attempt charge) and only escalate to digest errors past a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]grace window.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-1t0","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-1t0.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1t0.1"},"source_run_id":"run-6786ece11c4b3296b03de2fb429cc9eb","started_at":"2026-11-15T17:31:54.068581+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"23a190f22c8342d062666ea8df5d036f771cada26c39cd246ba45c69ea46c860","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.1--mon-0/chat.md","size_bytes":3234},"commits":{"digest":"edb4a362f80d2afeb588e5ec004be70e5d5d7cd2cc6f965a2968f64930ca8690","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.1--mon-0/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"7c5d6e3774177f77598792ec1f3382ac684c27f10698942f7f491454bb72d048","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.1--mon-0/meta.json","size_bytes":652},"state":{"digest":"4e9d8f0c02d930915ffa7f6022435042bf2c7b2cc8d4a56a85413071b4072548","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.1--mon-0/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-15T19:22:30.541408+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-1t0.1--mon-0","local_name":"sase-1t0.1--mon-0","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-1t0","agent_clan_generation":"20261115123045","agent_session":"sase-1t0.1","agent_session_role":"mon-0","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"mon-0","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-1t0.1"},"source_run_id":"run-6a3e74f59ccda45d92d6b2aca61f412e","started_at":"2026-11-15T19:16:41.89